How long will it take for someone to find some sort of mechanism
to implement it, and how long will it take for _that_ to shake
out and some sort of general "law," be it PPL, "government,"
or whatever, to happen?

Some possibly related questions:

How much will BlackNet Investigations be selling my extropians
dossier for?

How much will BlackNet Investigations sell me Tim's dossier?
(oops, forgot to put a for at the end of that; I'm in bsd mail
and can't get out to edit).

How much will it cost me to see who has shown interest in seeing
my dossier?

How much will someone besides BI sell me Tim's dossier for?

Are there any offers for me to go spelunking through my archives
for postings by Tim?

(None of these threats are serious, really, because Tim's message
